        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ossel’s Odyssey is a quirky 2.5D side-scrolling platformer in the spirit of classic Rayman-style games, but with its own absurd, dry sense of humor. Originally created by Oliver Stephan (creaturelab3d), it blends nostalgic gameplay with oddball surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can discover strange graffiti, unlock hidden music tracks, and stumble across unexpected moments that might just make you blow air through your nose. Whether you’re chasing high scores or simply exploring, the world is packed with subtle jokes and little mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By Oliver Stephan creaturelab3d and Juri Knauth, past members, Carla Heinzel. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimized for X-Box controller. To make the X-Box controller work, please follow this: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Steam: right-click your game → Properties → Controller → “Override for o_Ossel´s Odyssey” → Disable Steam Input.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ossel’s Odyssey is a quirky 2.5D side-scrolling platformer in the spirit of classic Rayman-style games, but with its own absurd, dry sense of humor. Originally created by Oliver Stephan (creaturelab3d), it blends nostalgic gameplay with oddball surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can discover strange graffiti, unlock hidden music tracks, and stumble across unexpected moments that might just make you blow air through your nose. Whether you’re chasing high scores or simply exploring, the world is packed with subtle jokes and little mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By Oliver Stephan creaturelab3d and Juri Knauth, past members, Carla Heinzel. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimized for X-Box controller. To make the X-Box controller work, please follow this: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Steam: right-click your game → Properties → Controller → “Override for o_Ossel´s Odyssey” → Disable Steam Input.</p>",
